      "content": "he's finally settling down a bit but he's still warm. i really cannot go to the ER right now, it's a whole production and i'm alone with him. if i just split the adult pill in half, like a tiny bit, it would basically be the same as a kids dose right? i'm just trying to help him sleep so we can deal with it in the morning. what do u think?",
